      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><h2 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\">We want to revolutionize Democracy with you </h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\" data-text-attribute-id=\"f42ba75f-888f-4fee-be93-046727a76a14\">share your experience!</span></h2></div>",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": {
              "area": "1/2/3/10",
              "zIndex": 2,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            },
            "desktop": {
              "area": "1/8/6/20",
              "zIndex": 2,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Dear Reader,</h4><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are excited to launch <strong>EuroSense,</strong> an innovative project that builds a European Citizen Sensor Network!</p></div>",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": {
              "area": "3/2/5/10",
              "zIndex": 3,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            },
            "desktop": {
              "area": "6/5/9/23",
              "zIndex": 3,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><p style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\"><strong>We want YOU to be part of it!</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Together we can make <strong>democracy more inclusive</strong>. The more <strong>polarised </strong>and <strong>fragmented </strong>European societies become, the harder it is to <strong>unite Europe</strong>. We need to be<strong> innovative and forward-looking. </strong>We need to <strong>bridge social divides</strong> and<strong> </strong>work towards<strong> common solutions</strong>.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\"><strong><em>But how do we do this?</em></strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">By using <strong>innovative technology</strong> to <strong>make sense of real life experiences</strong>, we can shape <strong>citizen-centred </strong>activism and policy. A <strong>Sense Maker tool </strong>allows us to <strong>collect </strong>thousands of stories, with <strong>context and meaning</strong> provided by citizens themselves. This is a <strong>ground-breaking approach to citizen participation</strong> that only we can deliver on this scale, from the local to the European level.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Take a <strong>few minutes</strong> of your time to help us shine a light on the <strong>diverse perspectives</strong> that shape our community. <strong>Your story</strong> will contribute to our <strong>collective understanding</strong> and play a vital role in kick-starting this <strong>democratic innovation</strong>.</p></div>",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": {
              "area": "5/2/7/10",
              "zIndex": 1,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            },
            "desktop": {
              "area": "9/5/23/23",
              "zIndex": 1,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            }
          }
        },
